  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *hallado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to find\" — a more formal/literary synonym of *encontrar*, common in writing and set expressions: *hallar la solución* (to find the solution), *hallar la verdad* (to find the truth)",
    "Reflexive *hallarse* means \"to be located\" or \"to find oneself (in a state)\": *se halla muy débil* (he/she finds himself/herself very weak)",
    "Related: *hallazgo* (finding, discovery — noun), *hallado/a* (found)"
  ],
